  "title": "Grilled Sirloin Salad with Sesame-Ginger Dressing",
  "description": "Grilled sirloin salad and grilled vegetables are tossed together in a sesame-ginger dressing in this fresh salad perfect for summertime.",
  "authors": [
    "Ashley Delilah Lane"
  ],
